<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F28_Expression_Creation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "F28 Creazione dell'espressione"@it .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F28_Expression_Creation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E7_Activity> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F28_Expression_Creation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, F28 Expression Creation is used to represent the compositional event that produces a textual expression and in which a literary constraint may be employed. The properties that can be used with this class are crm:P14_carried_out_by, dcterms:created, desmos:usedConstraint and lrmoo:R17_created."@en .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F28_Expression_Creation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F28_Expression_Creation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, F28 Expression Creation è utilizzata per rappresentare l'evento compositivo che produce un'espressione testuale e nel quale può essere impiegata una costrizione letteraria. Le proprietà che possono essere usate con questa classe sono crm:P14_carried_out_by, dcterms:created, desmos:usedConstraint e lrmoo:R17_created."@it .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F28_Expression_Creation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F28_Expression_Creation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "F28 Expression Creation"@en .
